WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.040
Dear Jesus, may I enter into the eternal divine order of God to place my absolute nothingness

2
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:12.880
in the heart of the most holy Trinity, to give to my God the joy of fulfilling the purpose of my

3
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:18.800
existence by doing all the acts of my life through the immaculate heart of my mother Mary

4
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:26.400
and in the divine will of God. And in this same manner may I live, pray, act, eat, walk, sleep,

5
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:32.240
and do everything. May my soul be devoid of any other longings, wants or desires,

6
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:37.920
and may you my beloved divine will do with me whatever you want or desire.

7
00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:44.640
All I ask is that you bind me to your most holy will so intimately that I may never swear from

8
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:50.560
carrying out what I know to be your good pleasure, and that I remain so docile to the movements of

9
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:57.440
your divine will, that you never perceive even a breath of resistance in my soul to your requests

10
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:03.920
of me. Come divine will with all the angels and saints, especially my sweet mother Mary,

11
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:09.680
to touch my forehead, to imprint on it the Holy Spirit and infuse in me true light,

12
00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:15.680
so that I may understand the truths and the good that are in these writings and prayers. Amen.

13
00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:26.880
So we want to begin with July the 23rd 1926. And in this wonderful message, the Lord is going to

14
00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.680
let us know what living in heaven while you're still on earth is actually like.

15
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:37.840
So Louisa said, "After much waiting and longing for the coming of my sweet Jesus,

16
00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:44.240
I was thinking to myself, 'How can I go on? If the one who forms my life leaves me alone and

17
00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:51.200
abandoned, how can I possibly live?' Now we've dealt with this many, many times that Louisa's life

18
00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:57.120
is actually miraculous. And so if Jesus abandons her in the sense that she is talking about,

19
00:01:57.120 --> 00:02:04.560
she would in fact die because she's only maintained miraculously in life. And she said,

20
00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:11.520
'If I do live, because now I understand that it is not the pains that make one die. If it were so,

21
00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:18.080
after many of his privations, he said, 'I will be dead.' At the most they make one feel death,

22
00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:24.400
but they are unable to give it. They are the pains. They make one live as though under a press,

23
00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:32.240
they get seminee press, press like they all have squeezed and crushed, but the supreme will alone

24
00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:38.640
has the power of death. Now I want you to know that this is dealt with in volume four in January

25
00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:45.040
the 25th, 1902, so that if you want to write that down as a reference. Because there she discovered

26
00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:50.880
this whole thing about she could be feeling that she was dying and that her body had no ability to

27
00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:57.360
go on, but natural fact if the divine will decreed that you live on, you live on. And no matter what

28
00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:02.800
condition you're in, and if the divine will decrees that this is your moment to leave the earth, well

29
00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:07.760
that is the moment you leave the earth. It's whatever the divine will decrees, which he said,

30
00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:13.760
while I was thinking of this, my adorable Jesus moved in my interior, which of course means that

31
00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:22.960
the kingdom of God is within. That is Luke 1721 and 1 Corinthians 3 16. So Jesus moved in my

32
00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:29.920
interior and he made himself seen with a little gold chain in his hands. Now notice it's a gold

33
00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:37.200
chain, gold is of God. It was in his hands, delighting in making it pass between me and himself.

34
00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:43.120
In such a way that we remained bound together. You see, this is the union. That's why I said the

35
00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:50.720
gold is of God. And with love and goodness all paternal, he told me, my daughter, why do you fear

36
00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:57.520
that I would leave you? No, I won't comment on that. We've had that for 19 volumes. Listen, he said,

37
00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:04.320
I find this bit interesting. I can no longer tolerate this fear in you. In other words,

38
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:11.920
haven't I explained it over and over and over again about this deprivation and stuff? He said,

39
00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:16.960
I can't tolerate it any longer. There comes a point where it's no longer a subject for discussion.

40
00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:23.040
Everything has been discussed. And he wants her to just accept where she is. Now she does

41
00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:30.160
theoretically, but we have emotional journeys to take as well. So if you want to leave me, he said,

42
00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:35.600
you won't find the way out. And as much as you may go around, you will always go around

43
00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:41.440
within the endless boundaries of the divine will. Now, if you're at the level of possession which

44
00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:46.880
she is, you're there permanently. Therefore you're living in heaven while you're on the earth. And

45
00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:51.920
because you're on the earth, you have the suffering and the pain and the redemptive side of things.

46
00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:57.520
But she's living the heavenly life on earth. So there's no way out of this. Once you have moved

47
00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:04.080
into the eternal spheres, that's it. It's permanent. And many of the, sorry, I should say several of

48
00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:13.280
the volumes before, volume 19, we had Louisa describing going into the whole arena of the light,

49
00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:19.120
and that there was no possibility of even seeing boundaries. And the Lord had given her the image

50
00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:26.720
of a fish in the ocean. And the fish would not know how to describe an ocean. Even though that

51
00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:34.480
was exactly where the life was. And Louisa has this difficulty as well. So if you want to go out,

52
00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:40.960
he said, you won't find the way out, because this is a permanent situation. And more so since your

53
00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:48.240
acts done in the divine will have closed the door, I want you to notice that and I want you to underline

54
00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:55.120
it. Every time you do an act in the divine will, you're binding yourself more and more and more

55
00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:02.800
to the divine will. And so the door to everything that's extraneous to that begins to close, close,

56
00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:09.040
close, finally it closes permanently. And this is where Louisa is at. It has closed permanently.

57
00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:15.520
And so every one of your acts done in the divine will have closed every way out for you. And it's

58
00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:21.200
what you did yourself voluntarily. And if I wanted to leave you, Jesus said, I couldn't,

59
00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:26.000
because I would not know where to go to place myself outside of the boundaries of my will. In

60
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:32.240
other words, you've entered into my will permanently. And therefore there's no way I can separate from

61
00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:38.560
you either. My will is everywhere. As you know, from Psalm 139, where can I go from your spirit?

62
00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:44.000
Where can I flee from your face? If I go to the heavens, you are there. If I go into the depths of

63
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:49.360
the sea, you are there. Even darkness is not dark to you. The night is as bright as the day. So

64
00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:56.160
the divine will is everywhere. And wherever I might go, I would always find myself together

65
00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:03.680
with you. This is the aspect of the thing that Jesus wants us to look at. That now that Louisa

66
00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:09.360
has entered permanently, not that it's happened at this moment, but Jesus is just trying to give

67
00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:15.200
her understanding of what has happened a long time ago. Now that Louisa has entered permanently

68
00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:20.000
into the divine will, wherever the divine will is, she is. Therefore she's in everything.

69
00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:25.600
That's absolutely amazing. Or as they say nowadays, it's beyond amazing.

70
00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:33.120
Wherever I might go, he said, I would always find myself together with you. That's the golden

71
00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:40.880
chain of the two wills bound together. At most, I act like someone who possesses a large house.

72
00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:46.240
And since he loves someone who is inferior to him in mutual agreement, one takes the house

73
00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:52.640
and the other goes. Now, since the house is large, he ranges about and moves around within his own

74
00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:57.840
property. And the other person loses sight of him and laments round him. That's very much the image

75
00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:04.960
of a very small child who, as soon as the mother leaves the kitchen and goes upstairs to do something,

76
00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:10.640
the child thinks it's abandoned. And Louisa gives that reaction to Jesus. If the house belongs to

77
00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:17.920
him, how could he leave her? One doesn't leave one's own things. So either he will come home soon,

78
00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:23.440
or he's already there, you know, and some other part of the house. Okay, so the next paragraph,

79
00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:31.760
we are inseparable, which he has just stated, by the way. Therefore, since I have given you

80
00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:40.400
my will as your house, as your home, there's your one Corinthians 3 16 again, and your Luke 17 21,

81
00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:47.360
how can I leave you and separate from my will? It's not possible. As powerful as I am,

82
00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:56.400
in this I am impotent because I am inseparable from my will. And Louisa is also now inseparable

83
00:08:56.400 --> 00:09:03.200
from his will. Therefore, she's living as the saints live in heaven, inseparable from God.

84
00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:09.120
At the most, he said, I range within my boundaries and you lose sight of me,

85
00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:15.440
but it's not because I leave you. And if you went round within our boundaries, notice the hour

86
00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:23.520
because she has taken possession immediately would find me. So instead of fearing you should wait

87
00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:29.680
for me, that's Isaiah 40 31, those who wait upon the Lord shall renew their strength,

88
00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:33.680
they shall mount up with wings like the eagle, they shall run and not be weary,

89
00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:40.480
they shall walk and not faint. So you should wait for me, and when you least expected,

90
00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:49.200
you will find me all clasped to you. Now, we have 19 volumes to prove that last point. Jesus comes

91
00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:57.680
unexpectedly, but let me give you a few scriptures. Matthew 24, 43, 1 Thessalonians 5, 2, and Revelation

92
00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:03.440
16, 13, he comes like a thief in the night. And in the Revelation 1, he's coming to us

93
00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:10.480
in his return like a thief in the night. It'll be like completely sudden even though we're expecting

94
00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:17.440
it. So the Lord appears and disappears at will, but he's there all the time, just like in the

95
00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:22.320
resurrection scenes in the gospel, Jesus appeared and disappeared, but he was there all the time.

96
00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:28.000
It's just that they perceived him at particular points and didn't perceive him at other points,

97
00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:34.160
and that's the reality of living in possession of the divine will as well. Sometimes the light

98
00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:39.920
eclipses everything and you only see the light. Sometimes you will actually see whatever the

99
00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:45.600
Lord wants to show you, but it's different according to different circumstances. So the

100
00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:51.520
whole plan of the divine will is coming out now in the next section. So after this, Louisa said,

101
00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:58.080
I was doing my usual acts in the supreme volition and the whole order that one must have in the

102
00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:05.520
divine will, what one must do and where one can reach. That's very important. Look at those three

103
00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:12.640
things. The whole order in the divine will, what we must do and how far we can reach. In some,

104
00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:18.400
everything that Jesus himself has taught me became present before my mind. I'd love to have that

105
00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:23.280
kind of presence, wouldn't you? Instead of saying to myself, now, where will I find that?

106
00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:29.280
So Louisa said, I talked to myself and this is extremely important because this question is about

107
00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:35.920
you and me. How will other creatures be able to do all this? Because Louisa has received so

108
00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:43.600
much help from Jesus, so much help. And she couldn't move an inch without his specific intervention.

109
00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:48.960
So she's wondering because he has told her she's going to have a whole progeny in the divine will.

110
00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:54.640
So how is it going to happen? She said, if it seems to me that I who draw from the source,

111
00:11:54.640 --> 00:12:01.120
that is directly from Jesus, don't do everything. I leave many things behind and I don't reach the

112
00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:07.360
height that Jesus tells me to. What must be for those who will draw from my tiny little fount?

113
00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:13.600
This is very, very interesting because while everything is offered, that doesn't mean you can

114
00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:19.200
actually reach everything. Before I go on any further, I want to give you a very, very simple

115
00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:25.600
example. I go into a supermarket, there's a massive amount of stuff there. Am I going to buy it all?

116
00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:32.720
Absolutely no. Do I need it all? No. There's more than me on the planet. There are many other

117
00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:38.640
people going to come into this same supermarket and they will want things that I don't want and

118
00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:44.400
I will want things they don't want, but everything gets covered. And it's exactly the same going

119
00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:50.000
into the divine will. And that's why I've told my groups from the beginning that we need to give a

120
00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:57.360
personal spontaneous response to the Lord in the divine will so that he can get everything covered.

121
00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:03.120
But if we're all saying the same words at the same time and doing the same act all the time,

122
00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:11.040
then only that tiny section of the divine will is covered. But if the spontaneity is allowed,

123
00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:16.640
we will find ourselves doing different things and the Lord alone will be in charge, which will be

124
00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:23.920
wonderful. So she's worried about us. And Jesus moving in my interior told me, now notice it's all

125
00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:29.440
coming from her interior because that's where the kingdom of God is. My daughter, he said,

126
00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:36.560
of the many things that I created in creation, you do not use or enjoy them all. Nor have you

127
00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:41.920
seen the half. I mean, how many of us have traveled the whole earth and seen every mountain, every hill,

128
00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:49.280
every valley, every wonder that's on the earth. It's still actually possible. And even at this stage

129
00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:55.840
in human history, we now know that the mystery of the oceans has not yet been really, really

130
00:13:55.840 --> 00:14:01.760
discovered. We've only touched a tiny bit of the mystery of the oceans. So even the whole of humanity

131
00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:07.200
isn't able to do it let alone individuals. So he said, there are many things that I created in

132
00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:13.760
creation that you do not use nor enjoy all of them and many others that you don't even know about.

133
00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:22.240
But if they don't serve you, they serve others. That's my bit about the supermarket. If you are not

134
00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:28.720
the one who enjoys them and knows them, others do enjoy them and know them. So this massive variety,

135
00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:35.840
not only in creation, but in the kingdom of God. And if creatures don't take everything,

136
00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:42.960
all things will serve from my great glory to make known my power, my majesty, and my great love.

137
00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:49.680
It's all about him. It's not about us. And the multiplicity of the many creation things

138
00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:57.520
makes known the wisdom and the value of the divine maker or creator who is so skillful

139
00:14:57.520 --> 00:15:03.440
that there is nothing he cannot do. So it means that for the whole of our lives and indeed for

140
00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:11.680
the whole of human history, we never ever get over the wonder and awe of just the extraordinary

141
00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:19.120
variety that's in creation. Now he said, if in the creation of the world he released so many things

142
00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:26.160
which were to serve man's nature, that is human nature, and which were to be like a mirror in which

143
00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:32.800
by reflecting himself in it, man was to recognize his creator. So here we've had this many times

144
00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:41.200
before that creation is a veil hiding the presence of God and the divine will is in every single thing.

145
00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:47.840
And all created things were to be paths through which he could return to the paternal room from

146
00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:55.600
which he came. So the very desire that human beings have to explore the earth, to find out its wonders

147
00:15:56.160 --> 00:16:03.040
and to somehow get to know as much of as possible, that's the drawing of the Lord to get us to

148
00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:08.560
contemplate his works so that we would know the worker from the work.

149
00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:17.200
So much more necessary is it to make known more things about the kingdom of my will. That's why

150
00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:23.040
there are so many volumes in this teaching because this is to serve the life of the soul

151
00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:30.720
and as the center in which God is to have his throne. Now here you have said quite clearly in a way.

152
00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:37.600
So the throne of God on earth is not just the tabernacle in the church because there's no

153
00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:43.440
relationship between the sacred host and the box that's holding it. So the throne of God on earth

154
00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:50.640
is our own soul and the kingdom of God is there inside of us and he wants to develop that more

155
00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:56.800
and more and more and the more he's allowed to develop it in each one of us the more it will spread

